 3 a+2 ,β1 = 1,3,4 T,β2 = 0,1,2 T, 若方程组Ax = β1 有解, 且Ax = β2 无解,则a =\n1 a -2\n_____.","kp_ids":["la.eq.solvability"],"part":"base","img":"/math/img/ll/ll-base-13-fill-2.jpg","ans_img":"/math/img/ll-ans/ll-base-13-fill-2.jpg","facets":["solvability","vector_link"]},{"id":"ll-base-13-big-1","source":"lilin880","book":"linear","kind":"big","section":"13","section_name":"线性方程组","qno":1,"pdf_page":152,"stem":"求方程组 的通解.\n3x1+x2+x3=1,\n7x1+7x3-3x4=3\n2x1+λx2-x3=1,","kp_ids":["la.eq.solvability"],"part":"base","img":"/math/img/ll/ll-base-13-big-1.jpg","ans_img":"/math/img/ll-ans/ll-base-13-big-1.jpg","facets":["compute_gauss"]},{"id":"ll-base-13-big-2","source":"lilin880","book":"linear","kind":"big","section":"13","section_name":"线性方程组","qno":2,"pdf_page":153,"stem":"设方程组 λx1-x2+x3=2, 问λ 为何值时, 方程组无解、有唯一解、有无穷多解？当有无穷\n4x1+5x2-5x3=-1,\n多解时, 求其通解.\nx1+x2=0, x1-x2+x3=0,","kp_ids":["la.eq.solvability"],"part":"base","img":"/math/img/ll/ll-base-13-big-2.jpg","ans_img":"/math/img/ll-ans/ll-base-13-big-2.jpg","facets":["solvability","compute_gauss"]},{"id":"ll-base-13-big-3","source":"lilin880","book":"linear","kind":"big","section":"13","section_name":"线性方程组","qno":3,"pdf_page":153,"stem":"设有方程组① 与方程组② 求:\nx2-x4=0 x2-x3+x4=0.\n(I) 方程组①与②的基础解系;\n(II) 方程组①与②的非零公共解.\nx1+x2=0,","kp_ids":["la.eq.common","la.eq.structure"],"part":"base","img":"/math/img/ll/ll-base-13-big-3.jpg","ans_img":"/math/img/ll-ans/ll-base-13-big-3.jpg","facets":["common_same","nullspace"]},{"id":"ll-base-13-big-4","source":"lilin880","book":"linear","kind":"big","section":"13","section_name":"线性方程组","qno":4,"pdf_page":154,"stem":"设有方程组(I) (II)Ax = 0，其中(II) 的基础解系为α1 = -1,2,2,1 T,\nx2-x4=0,\nα2 = 0,-1,-1,0 T,求方程组(I) 与(II) 的非零公共解.","kp_ids":["la.eq.common","la.eq.structure"],"part":"base","img":"/math/img/ll/ll-base-13-big-4.jpg","ans_img":"/math/img/ll-ans/ll-base-13-big-4.jpg","facets":["common_same","nullspace"]},{"id":"ll-base-13-big-5","source":"lilin880","book":"linear","kind":"big","section":"13","section_nam